      "content": "They aren't coming to capture us. They're coming to butcher what's left. I can't face them like this... looking like a coward, a failure. I'd rather go out on my own terms than let them laugh while they take my head. Is there any dignity left for a man like me, or am I just waiting to be humiliated?",
